OL,3,GNEWSAKing Charles visits Cairngorms
OL,4,Aafter summer wildfire
OL,5,
OL,6,FKing Charles has expressed "admiration
OL,7,Fand appreciation" for those who helped
OL,8,Ftackle this summer's wildfire in the
OL,9,FCairngorms.
OL,11,FThe king travelled to An Lochan Uaine `
OL,12,Fcommonly known as the Green Lochan
OL,13,F-where he met volunteers, firefighters
OL,14,Fand landowners who were part of the
OL,15,Fefforts.
OL,17,FThe fire broke out in the Glenmore area
OL,18,Fnear Aviemore on July 15 and burned
OL,19,Facross 3,300 hectares of land for
OL,20,Falmost five weeks.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
