OL,3,GNEWSAKing Charles visits Cairngorms
OL,4,Aafter summer wildfire
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a statement, Charles thanked "all
OL,7,Fthose who have worked so tirelessly and
OL,8,Fcourageously" to bring this year's
OL,9,Fwildfires under control across the UK.
